  "post_content": "<p>El sal&oacute;n de actos del colegio Virgen del Carmen de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este viernes un recital del poeta Javi Aguilella, acompa&ntilde;ado a la guitarra por Luis Mu&ntilde;oz, y a la viola y guitarra por H&eacute;ctor Madue&ntilde;o, todos ellos ondenses.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_1693.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El recital era un nuevo acto de los muchos organizados en conmemoraci&oacute;n del 50&ordm; aniversario del actual colegio Virgen del Carmen en el interior del caso urbano de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1683.jpg\" alt=\"img_1683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1684.jpg\" alt=\"img_1684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1685.jpg\" alt=\"img_1685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1686.jpg\" alt=\"img_1686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1687.jpg\" alt=\"img_1687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1688.jpg\" alt=\"img_1688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1689.jpg\" alt=\"img_1689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1690.jpg\" alt=\"img_1690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1691.jpg\" alt=\"img_1691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1692.jpg\" alt=\"img_1692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1693.jpg\" alt=\"img_1693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1694.jpg\" alt=\"img_1694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1695.jpg\" alt=\"img_1695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1696.jpg\" alt=\"img_1696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1697.jpg\" alt=\"img_1697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reditaljaviaguilellavergecarme/img_1698.jpg\" alt=\"img_1698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
